<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>
        <%= title %>
    </title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
        integrity="sha384-sRIl4kxILFvY47J16cr9ZwB07vP4J8+LH7qKQnuqkuIAvNWLzeN8tE5YBujZqJLB" crossorigin="anonymous">
</head>

<body>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-4">
            <nav id="navbar-example3" class="h-100 flex-column align-items-stretch pe-4 border-end">
                <nav class="nav nav-pills flex-column">
                    <a class="nav-link" href="#item-1">Item 1</a>
                    <nav class="nav nav-pills flex-column">
                        <a class="nav-link ms-3 my-1" href="#item-1-1">Item 1-1</a>
                        <a class="nav-link ms-3 my-1" href="#item-1-2">Item 1-2</a>
                    </nav>
                    <a class="nav-link" href="#item-2">Item 2</a>
                    <a class="nav-link" href="#item-3">Item 3</a>
                    <nav class="nav nav-pills flex-column">
                        <a class="nav-link ms-3 my-1" href="#item-3-1">Item 3-1</a>
                        <a class="nav-link ms-3 my-1" href="#item-3-2">Item 3-2</a>
                    </nav>
                </nav>
            </nav>
        </div>

        <div class="col-8">
            <div data-bs-spy="scroll" data-bs-target="#navbar-example3" data-bs-smooth-scroll="true"
                class="scrollspy-example-2" tabindex="0">
                <div id="item-1">
                    <h4>
                        <%= heading1 %>
                    </h4>
                    <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Velit, dicta quisquam. Architecto
                        dignissimos ipsum dolore illo quo ad nostrum possimus error tempora eius quaerat, deleniti atque
                        qui officiis laudantium culpa.</p>
                </div>
                <div id="item-1-1">
                    <h5>
                        <%= subheading1 %>
                    </h5>
                    <p>
                    <ul>
                        <% users.forEach(user=> { %>
                            <li>
                                <% if (user.age>= 18) { %>
                                    <p>Welcome adult user!</p>
                                    <% } else { %>
                                        <p>Sorry, underage user.</p>
                                        <% } %>
                            </li>
                            <% }) %>
                    </ul>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div id="item-1-2">
                    <h5>
                        <%= subheading2 %>
                    </h5>
                    <p>
                    <ol>
                        <% users.forEach(user=> { %>
                            <li>
                                <!-- <%= user %> -->
                                <%= user.name %> - <%= user.age %>
                            </li>
                            <% }) %>
                    </ol>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div id="item-2">
                    <h4>Item 2</h4>
                    <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Aut sint libero consequatur iusto
                        blanditiis cum nobis expedita, velit fuga porro necessitatibus! Cupiditate at alias maxime quo
                        magni ducimus mollitia recusandae.</p>
                </div>
                <div id="item-3">
                    <h4>Item 3</h4>
                    <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Sunt mollitia dolorum sapiente laborum,
                        quaerat quisquam debitis molestias porro aut et incidunt, accusamus accusantium iure rerum ex
                        odit modi voluptate dignissimos..120</p>
                </div>
                <div id="item-3-1">
                    <h5>Item 3-1</h5>
                    <p>
                        <lore class="150">Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Ipsam laboriosam
                            repudiandae mollitia delectus ducimus consectetur aut est error, libero nostrum corporis
                            quod esse quam provident expedita, illum necessitatibus enim quia!
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div id="item-3-2">
                    <h5>Item 3-2</h5>
                    <p>This is some placeholder content for the scrollspy page. Note that as you scroll down the page,
                        the appropriate navigation link is highlighted. It’s repeated throughout the component example.
                        We keep adding some more example copy here to emphasize the scrolling and highlighting.

                        Keep in mind that the JavaScript plugin tries to pick the right element among all that may be
                        visible. Multiple visible scrollspy targets at the same time may cause some issues.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"
        integrity="sha384-FKyoEForCGlyvwx9Hj09JcYn3nv7wiPVlz7YYwJrWVcXK/BmnVDxM+D2scQbITxI"
        crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</body>

</html>